The '''engorged bloodwood tree''' is a variant of the [[bloodwood tree]]s native to [[Vampyrium]]. Like the standard bloodwood trees, chopping it requires completion of [[The Blood Moon Rises]], 77 [[Woodcutting]] and an empty [[bucket]], yielding [[bloodwood sap]] which can be used to upgrade [[arrow]]s into [[seeking arrows]]. 

An [[aranei bucket dealer]] standing near the tree will supply buckets free of charge via their "Take" or "Take-many" [[option]]s.

Compared to the standard [[bloodwood tree]]s, the engorged bloodwood tree requires far less input to chop, but at a considerably reduced rates of sap and experience. 

This tree does not spawn [[Forestry events]], nor is there an invisible [[Temporary_skill_boost#Woodcutting|Woodcutting boost]] when chopping the tree with other players.

